{"id":"662927","name":"柿汁豆腐","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/662927/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡汤","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小柿子","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"刚买的大豆腐还热乎着呢。","img":"images/662927/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将豆腐冲洗干净，切成小方块状。","img":"images/662927/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小柿子就是那做柿子饼的小柿子，去除外皮。","img":"images/662927/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过细筛过滤出柿子汁。","img":"images/662927/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淀粉水适量。","img":"images/662927/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中鸡汤中加盐熬煮。","img":"images/662927/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入适量鸡汤，豆腐块、生抽、料酒、盐烧开。","img":"images/662927/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入过滤好的柿子汁。","img":"images/662927/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮10分钟，加入鸡精即可。","img":"images/662927/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"这是自己种的薄荷还没长大，摘几朵洗净。","img":"images/662927/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"柿子汁豆腐盛入碗中，薄荷点缀。","img":"images/662927/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}